=== WEB-PARITY MAP (features/admin/components/feature-flags/FlagEditDrawer.tsx -> native) ===
================================================================================
  props open / initial / saving / onClose / onSave         -> FlagEditRequest + FlagEditDrawerController
  editing = initial !== null                               -> FlagEditRequest.mode (FlagEditMode)
  defaultValueJson(initial) (JSON.stringify(value,null,2))  -> FlagEditDrawerProjection.defaultValueJSON
  parsed memo ('' -> valueEmpty; JSON.parse -> value;       -> FlagEditDrawerProjection.parseValue +
     catch -> 'Invalid JSON: {{msg}}')                          .valueErrorMessage (FlagEditValueParse)
  re-seed key/value/reason on [open, initial]               -> model.reseedIfNeeded (SeedKey excludes
                                                                 `saving` so in-flight edits survive)
  keyValid / reasonValid (trim().length>0)                  -> FlagEditDrawerProjection.isNonBlank
  canSave = parsed.ok && keyValid && reasonValid && !saving -> FlagEditDrawerProjection.canSave
  handleSave -> onSave({ key:trim, value, reason:trim })    -> model.save() (trimmed key+reason+value)
  Drawer onClose / footer Cancel(disabled=saving)           -> model.dismiss() / model.cancel()
  title editTitle "Edit flag \"{{key}}\"" / createTitle     -> FlagEditDrawerProjection.title
  Input(keyLabel, disabled=editing) + keyImmutable note     -> FlagEditKeyField (+ immutable note)
  Textarea(valueLabel, error=parsed.error)                  -> FlagEditValueField (prompt + error)
  Input(reasonLabel)                                        -> FlagEditReasonField
  useTranslation t(key, default)                            -> FlagEditDrawerStrings (P1/S10 table
                                                                 "FlagEditDrawer")
  FeatureFlagValue = unknown (JSON)                         -> FlagEditJSONValue (FlagEdit-prefixed to
                                                                 avoid colliding with sibling FlagValue)

  i18n keys extracted from source (all resolve through P1/S10, no English literals in Swift):
    admin.flags.drawer.editTitle / createTitle / save  | common.cancel
    admin.flags.editor.keyLabel / keyPlaceholder / keyImmutable / valueLabel / valueEmpty /
    admin.flags.editor.valueInvalid / reasonLabel / reasonPlaceholder

  States reproduced (every one renders real chrome — engineering guideline #6, never a blank box):
    loading (request resolving) | empty (no flag selected) | error (delivery failed + retry)
    | content (the create/edit form) | inline-error (cached request + failed reload)
    | freshness chip Live/Stale/Offline + cached-data banner (ADR-013)
    | invalid-JSON parse error (Save disabled + red helper) | in-flight saving (form disabled +
    | Save spinner, web `saving` prop)

Collision-safety (rule 9): every public type is `FlagEdit…`-prefixed and checked unique across the
  whole module BEFORE writing. The sibling FlagsTable surface (feature-views) already declares
  `FlagValue` + `FeatureFlagEntry`; ours are `FlagEditJSONValue` / `FlagEditInitial` to avoid a
  duplicate-type collision. No shared file touched.

